<title>USA: St Paul hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts compared with Thursday, were steady to $0.50 lower. Top $52.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	  220-250 lbs     52.50</p>
<p>			250-260 lbs     52.00-52.50</p>
<p>			260-270 lbs     51.00-52.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3	  270-280 lbs     50.00-51.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	   300-450 lbs    43.00-44.50</p>
<p>			 450-500 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>			 500-550 lbs    48.50</p>
<p>			 550-700 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
</text>
